WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:02.700
Wh-What was that just now?

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.010
Did that brat do that?

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:07.560
But that's impossible...

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:12.800
What are you hesitating for?

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:16.140
<b>Episode 6   "Promise"</b>

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.750
That child is an impure creature that 
will bring misfortune upon Heaven.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:19.000
Capture him! Capture him!

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Y-Yes, sir!

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:21.080
Come here!

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.620
Goku...

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:31.720
Wh-What the hell is going on?

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:32.550
Hey, Konzen!

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:36.540
The diadem... 
The diadem that was on his head...

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:40.040
That was his power limiter.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.680
So you're saying this is Goku's true form?

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:49.190
He's not a human or a demon. Much less a god.

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:53.290
Called the symbol of chaos, 
there is a being of legend

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:56.440
said to have power equal to that of Heaven...

00:00:57.260 --> 00:00:59.510
Seiten Taisei.

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:37.670
Where are you going? Protect me!

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:50.970
S-Stay away! Stay away from me, you monster!

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:54.910
That's enough! I can't stand 
watching this anymore!

00:02:54.910 --> 00:02:56.180
No one wants this!

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:59.190
Especially not you!

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:04.320
If you still want to go berserk, 
then play with me for a bit, Goku.

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:12.330
Well, looks like you're all having fun.

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:14.560
Kanzeon Bosatsu...

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:15.840
Don't.

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:18.960
You guys won't be able to 
handle that little shrimp.

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:20.880
Goku's...

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:24.230
Is there a way to restore his power limiter?

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:25.720
Restore it?

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:28.340
We just need to exterminate him.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:33.310
Bring it, you little shrimp. 
Let's get this over with.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.620
Stop—

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:41.610
Well, aren't you a lively one?

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:45.320
Don't take this personally.

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:57.290
You've got the nerve to hit me?

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:59.950
You've got some balls, Konzen Douji.

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:02.460
Don't regret this.

00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:07.930
Will you be able to remain
 that little shrimp's sun?

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:10.550
It's so shiny...

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:15.390
<i>No. I'm not his sun.</i>

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:16.900
<i>If anything...</i>

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:19.960
<i>If anything, the sun is...</i>

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:24.290
Yeah, I won't.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:35.480
You fool! As long as you're protecting 
that child, you'll be seen as a traitor!

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:39.040
And for those who dare to defy 
Heaven, the sentence is death!

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:43.200
Perish before you even have a chance 
to regret your actions, Konzen Douji!

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:46.980
You heard him.

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:49.660
What do you think, 
 wise Field Marshal Tenpou?

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:53.640
I can't really say. I'm a fool, as well,
 so I don't really understand.

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:56.270
Tenpou, Kenren...

00:04:56.500 --> 00:05:00.260
I guess if we're all idiots, 
we might as well all dance.

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:02.040
What the hell?

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:03.060
Never heard that one.

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:06.380
It's a famous saying down on Earth.

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:08.820
Konzen, can you run while holding Goku?

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:10.820
Don't mock me.

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:12.570
Kill them!

00:05:12.570 --> 00:05:14.810
Don't let any of them 
walk out of here alive!

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:19.160
Stop this! Halt!

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:22.380
General Kenren! Field Marshal Tenpou!

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:27.070
The Dragon King of the Western Sea!

00:05:27.070 --> 00:05:28.090
Goujun-sama!

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:30.490
Field Marshal Tenpou...

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:34.090
I do apologize for using such
 a cliché evildoer tactic.

00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:38.350
Now then, would you kindly 
get out of the way?

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:40.720
Goku.

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:43.300
Goku!

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:45.930
Konzen Douji.

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:49.860
Why would someone of your standing 
go against the military?

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:51.820
No particular reason.

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:55.360
I just decided that I didn't like what 
was going on and left it at that.

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:59.620
Then let me ask you this.
What can you possibly do?

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:05.160
Heaven's army will use everything 
they have to subjugate you four.

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:08.710
All because you wanted 
to protect this child.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:14.640
What could a sheltered man like you 
with no experience in battle possibly do?

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:17.270
Your demise awaits you.

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.750
That may be.

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:25.140
But we can't go back now, 
nor would I want to.

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:27.350
Konzen!

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.570
Back then...

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:41.420
You were the first one to reach 
out your hand, weren't you, Goku?

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:44.610
You're such a nuisance, honestly...

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:48.010
Now I'm never going to be able

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:52.670
to let go of that hand, no matter what.

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:02.290
Konzen...

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:05.190
Now then...

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:08.430
Our enemies aren't attacking 
thanks to our hostage,

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:11.290
but it's just a matter of time.

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:12.220
Yeah.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:15.690
Goku...

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:18.920
Are you sure you should be up?

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:21.210
Goku, what's wrong?

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:24.370
Ten-chan, Ken-nii...

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:27.090
You're not going to disappear, right?

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:31.210
You're not going to disappear from right 
in front of me like Nataku did, right?

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:35.050
I'll stay with you guys forever.

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:37.710
I love you guys, so...

00:07:37.710 --> 00:07:38.840
So...

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:42.300
You'll stay with me forever, too, right?

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:50.400
All right, Goku. Let me see your pinky.

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:52.060
My pinky?

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:54.420
What? You don't know?

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:58.670
Just like this.

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:01.100
This is called a pinky swear.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.450
It proves we're making a real promise.

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:05.830
Pinky swear...

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:10.830
It's all right, Goku. 
We'll always be by your side.

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:14.210
We're going to head towards the Earth.

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:19.340
Depending on how things go, 
we may have to split up.

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:23.720
But even if that happens, 
the next time we meet,

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:27.560
let it be beneath the cherry blossoms 
on Earth, no matter what.

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:33.820
I'm not telling you to capture them. Kill them!

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:40.270
Leave no stone unturned! 
Eliminate the roots of impurity from Heaven!

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:46.410
Wh-What the hell are those things?

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:52.110
Judging from the equipment in the room, 
I assume they were made here

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:55.900
in order to create Prince Nataku.

00:08:55.900 --> 00:09:00.260
So these are the failed experiments
 that came before him, huh?

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:04.920
I'll keep them busy.

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:07.230
All right.

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:10.910
Don't take this personally.

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:13.450
Kenren!

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:14.470
Ken-niichan!

00:09:14.770 --> 00:09:17.080
Get out of here!

00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:18.160
Or something.

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:22.400
I'll see you later.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:26.030
Indeed... See you later.

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:32.200
Okay, please come down.

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:32.200
Damn it. I can't find them.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.490
That's impossible!

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:39.420
I've done my job in leading you this far, 
so there's just one thing left for me to do.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:42.350
Field Marshal Tenpou!

00:09:44.030 --> 00:09:47.610
One of the traitors is here! 
Capture him! No, kill him!

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:49.270
After him! Don't let him get away!

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:50.560
Ten-chan—

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:53.230
Konzen...

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:55.790
No...

00:09:56.100 --> 00:09:56.980
I don't want this.

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:59.980
Ten-chan and Ken-niichan are...

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:04.250
And that's exactly why.

00:10:04.840 --> 00:10:07.450
You're smoking at a time like this?

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:12.170
It's because I'm in a situation like this

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:17.680
that it tastes even better, 
Dragon King Goujun.

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:22.140
We actually let you go 
and you still came down here?

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:23.930
Do you like me that much?

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:27.490
I ask that you surrender.

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:29.330
It's not too late to spare your life...

00:10:30.300 --> 00:10:32.380
You came to finish me off, didn't you?

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:36.130
If you just keep standing there, 
I'm going to kill you first.

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:37.560
Come at me.

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:38.440
Or...

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:42.450
Are you actually going to let 
this end without a conclusion?

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:45.330
You're the Dragon King, aren't you?

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.620
As usual, you're terrible at provocation.

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:03.060
Well, aren't you lucky? I'm out of bullets.

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:05.260
It appears so.

00:11:06.920 --> 00:11:08.040
Why are you laughing?

00:11:09.710 --> 00:11:12.270
Because I decided to.

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:19.740
Goujun!

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:30.050
Kenren! Come with me!

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:33.040
Oh, sorry...

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:36.750
I'm not very fond of heights.

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:42.910
If my feet aren't touching the ground,

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:46.050
I don't feel like I'm alive.

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:48.780
That's rather troublesome.

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:51.930
For real.

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:55.150
Yeah...

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:58.120
You want to live, too, huh?

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:00.940
If you're starving, eat something.

00:12:01.850 --> 00:12:04.140
If you're in pain, go wild.

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:07.000
If you're hurting, go ahead and scream.

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:07.940
That's...

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:10.100
what it means to be alive.

00:12:10.690 --> 00:12:13.530
Don't you dare leave a single bone!

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:15.740
Live! Live and survive!

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:19.660
No matter where that place may be,

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:22.960
no matter what form you may take...

00:12:23.230 --> 00:12:25.010
Bloom and bloom...

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:28.100
Until the day you fall, full of pride.

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:32.420
See ya later.

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:40.900
<i>Man, I could really go for a smoke right now.</i>

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:44.780
<i>But I only have a few left, 
so I'll have to buy more later.</i>

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:50.150
<i>Oh, right... I forgot to eat the 
instant ramen that I stocked up on.</i>

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:55.580
<i>The light in the bathroom is out... 
and I wonder how far I got in that book.</i>

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:02.870
<i>Oh, my glasses... I could've sworn I 
bought a spare pair quite some time ago,</i>

00:13:02.870 --> 00:13:05.100
<i>but I haven't seem them for a while.</i>

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:07.610
<i>Well, I'm sure they'll turn up sooner or later.</i>

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:13.350
<i>Probably when he comes to 
clean my room as usual.</i>

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.210
Now then...

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:25.520
I should get going.

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:29.780
Sorry to keep you waiting...

00:13:30.110 --> 00:13:32.260
Yes, I'm fine.

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:35.020
Yes, my glasses were broken.

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:37.340
Oh dear... I wonder if I dropped it.

00:13:37.340 --> 00:13:39.780
I'm sorry, but may I borrow your lighter?

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:47.300
Huh? Oh, I was just thinking...

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:51.290
how delicious this cigarette was.

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:55.890
<i>There's only one route from Heaven 
that leads down to Earth.</i>

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:59.600
<i>And that's through the dimensional 
gate that the army uses</i>

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:03.310
<i>on the bottom floor of 
the Tentei's palace grounds.</i>

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:08.080
<i>It was Kenren and Tenpou that 
cleared a path for us this far...</i>

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:12.580
<i>What can I possibly do for you?</i>

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:15.290
There are only two lookouts.

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:18.580
I'm sure they're so sparse because of Tenpou.

00:14:19.280 --> 00:14:20.760
It's no use after all.

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:22.120
Goku...

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.310
Let's stop this.

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:28.290
If you apologize, 
they might forgive you, right?

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:30.750
If we can't all go together, I...

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:33.520
Listen, Goku.

00:14:34.170 --> 00:14:38.880
Don't give up. If you believe 
in Kenren and Tenpou,

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:43.080
you need to make sure to not give up 
on them or yourself. No matter what.

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:46.130
<i>I've made up my mind</i>

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:48.600
<i>never to look away again.</i>

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:52.780
We made a promise, didn't we?

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:58.810
<i>That I wouldn't be ashamed
 of how I appear in your eyes.</i>

00:14:58.810 --> 00:14:59.700
Yeah.

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:03.580
So heavy!

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:11.340
This is...

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:15.900
It's the dimensional gate that 
connects Heaven and Earth!

00:15:16.230 --> 00:15:17.220
Konzen!

00:15:20.710 --> 00:15:23.970
How unfortunate. You were almost there.

00:15:24.760 --> 00:15:25.850
Konzen!

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:29.950
Child, what did they call you? Seiten Taisei?

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:33.730
A legendary being that's 
neither human nor demon...

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:40.990
If I had your body, Nataku could be 
reborn an even more invincible war god.

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:42.990
Survive...

00:15:44.570 --> 00:15:45.760
Status report, sir!

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:50.630
We've received word from the palacement laboratory 
and the eastern block of basement level 30

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:53.840
that the mission to vanquish the traitors, 
Field Marshal Tenpou and General Kenren,

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:56.380
has been completed successfully.

00:15:57.160 --> 00:16:00.750
Huh? Ken-niichan and Ten-chan...

00:16:01.130 --> 00:16:02.240
What happened to them?

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:11.450
This is called a pinky swear. 
It proves we're making a real promise.

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:16.160
It's all right, Goku. 
We'll always be by your side.

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:18.090
That's not true...

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:20.450
The next time we meet,

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:22.820
let it be beneath the cherry blossoms 
on Earth, no matter what.

00:16:22.820 --> 00:16:26.340
It's all lies!

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:27.000
What?!

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:44.780
<i>Earth is just beyond that light.</i>

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:52.770
Konzen!

00:16:53.980 --> 00:16:57.320
I'll be fine. More importantly, look...

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:00.560
The door's open!

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:02.410
Earth is right in front of you...

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:04.250
Goku, can you run?

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:05.090
Yeah!

00:17:06.260 --> 00:17:07.880
<i>I know...</i>

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:13.150
<i>that there's no guarantee of hope 
beyond the light we're heading towards.</i>

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:15.980
<i>It may end up hurting you instead...</i>

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:22.100
<i>But even so, I will do everything
 I can to get you there!</i>

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:25.950
Don't you dare mock me, you little rats!

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:31.400
The door's closing?!

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:35.800
Let this be a lesson to you!

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:40.420
Your hopes were all for naught!

00:17:41.840 --> 00:17:42.830
<i>No!</i>

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:44.070
Konzen, hurry!

00:17:44.650 --> 00:17:46.570
<i>Don't give up!</i>

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:49.640
Goku!

00:17:50.030 --> 00:17:52.740
Aren't they the same cherry blossoms?

00:17:52.740 --> 00:17:55.060
They live a different life.

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:56.580
I see.

00:17:57.070 --> 00:17:59.230
I would love to see them.

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:07.270
Konzen!

00:18:07.550 --> 00:18:09.810
Hurry up and go, Goku!

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:11.730
Konzen!

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:14.850
Open up, damn it!

00:18:14.850 --> 00:18:16.460
Go, Goku...

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:17.910
No!

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:18.760
Go...

00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:19.500
No!

00:18:19.610 --> 00:18:22.010
No!

00:18:22.010 --> 00:18:22.730
Goku!

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:29.510
You reached out your hand 
to me first, didn't you?

00:18:30.470 --> 00:18:31.640
Konzen?

00:18:32.010 --> 00:18:34.440
Next time, I'll...

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:36.880
I'll reach out to you...

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:40.260
I'll reach out to you, no matter what...

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:44.130
Yeah, you really are...

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:47.350
You really are like the sun...

00:18:57.720 --> 00:19:02.550
<i>Will you someday be able to reach</i>

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:06.820
<i>the promised place where the light shines?</i>

00:19:09.010 --> 00:19:11.220
Goku...

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:14.000
<i>A few days later,</i>

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:17.420
<i>the eternal cherry blossoms around the 
 palace that were supposed to bloom forever</i>

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:19.050
<i>all fell to the ground.</i>

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:23.560
<i>It's as though they were following them.</i>

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:28.290
Just how long do you plan on staying there?

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:31.360
<i>He was right there.</i>

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:34.080
<i>Right in front of the 
dimensional gate to Earth,</i>

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:38.360
<i>unmoving from the spot where he was 
separated from Konzen when he died.</i>

00:19:38.870 --> 00:19:41.850
<i>Huddled and still, just as if he were stone...</i>

00:19:43.270 --> 00:19:47.860
If you had a normal body, you would've 
died from starvation already.

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:51.070
Is that what you want, Goku?

00:19:52.260 --> 00:19:57.190
You are not Seiten Taisei. You're Goku, 
one who sees what others cannot.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:20:01.080
That's the name that Konzen gave you.

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:08.150
I'm sure you understand how
 you made it here still alive.

00:20:08.150 --> 00:20:10.610
Are you planning on letting 
it all go to waste, Goku?!

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:12.850
Konzen, Kenren, and Tenpou...

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:15.340
All of their hopes that they entrusted to you!

00:20:22.840 --> 00:20:25.000
We've put you through so much pain.

00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:33.700
Let me speak for my nephew, Konzen, 
and his close friends, Kenren and Tenpou...

00:20:34.550 --> 00:20:37.950
They were happy to meet you.

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:42.240
<i>Five hundred years of loneliness.</i>

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:45.970
<i>That was the punishment imposed 
on that little shrimp,</i>

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:51.970
<i>and there was an order to erase 
all of his memories of Heaven.</i>

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:57.290
<i>But there was just one memory 
that wouldn't go away...</i>

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:02.800
<i>And this is just my ego speaking,</i>

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:06.760
<i>but I think it's the name he was given.</i>

00:21:08.520 --> 00:21:12.780
<i>Now those five hundred years have passed, 
and Nataku has disappeared.</i>

00:21:13.610 --> 00:21:16.530
Something is starting to happen.

00:21:21.060 --> 00:21:23.180
We should get going.

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:24.470
Yeah.

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:29.020
<i>A storm...</i>

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:30.960
<i>is brewing.</i>

00:23:05.030 --> 00:23:10.020
<b>Episode 7
 "Kouten"</b>

00:23:05.630 --> 00:23:07.910
Episode 7, "Kouten."

00:23:07.910 --> 00:23:09.500
Watch without fail.
